<title>LATVIA: CENTRAL DEPOSITORY SHARE REGISTRATIONS.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL DEPOSITORY SHARE REGISTRATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central depository on Tuesday said it registered share issues by the following companies:</p>
<p>Olainfarm: 2,994,900 shares with nominal value one lat</p>
<p>Madona AB: 351,981 shares at one lat nominal</p>
<p>Grobina  : 497,500 shares at one lat nominal.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
